    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3397690/extras/7e9453bb63b8a00751be73f0157decf0.poster.avif?t=1747414907\" width=800 height=64 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3397690/extras/7e9453bb63b8a00751be73f0157decf0.webm?t=1747414907\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3397690/extras/7e9453bb63b8a00751be73f0157decf0.mp4?t=1747414907\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>WestFall \u2013 Can You Survive the Cursed West?</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>\u201cThe cursed town of the West\u2026 Every bounty hunter's soul eventually finds its way to WestFall.<br>Some came for fortune, others for fame. But none ever returned.\u201d</i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>WestFall</strong> offers a thrilling co-op survival experience set in a dark Western universe.<br>Rotting saloons, abandoned mines, and haunted train stations fill a land where every footstep echoes\u2014but who\u2019s listening remains a mystery...</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You and your crew are bounty hunters, scouring the outskirts of the town to recover valuable loot and pay off your debts. But when night falls, the spirits of the past awaken. Now, you're not just fighting for riches\u2014you're fighting for your soul.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Key Features:</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Horror + Western Fusion:</strong> A one-of-a-kind survival experience in a gothic Wild West setting.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Co-op Gameplay:</strong> Team up with 1-4 players. Take the job. Make it out. Or vanish forever.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Dynamic Missions:</strong> Each run brings new threats, rewards, and a different fate.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Mysterious Enemies:</strong> Ghost cowboys, vengeful spirits, and shadowy unknown horrors.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Time-Based Tension:</strong> When the sun sets, it doesn\u2019t just take the light\u2014it takes the hope with it.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In WestFall, your courage, your silence, your strategy\u2014and your loyalty\u2014will all be tested.<br><strong>Remember:</strong> Everyone who enters WestFall\u2026 ends up on the wanted list.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3397690/extras/ce9d384719fc514949adb183a36e0217.poster.avif?t=1747414907\" width=800 height=64 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3397690/extras/ce9d384719fc514949adb183a36e0217.webm?t=1747414907\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3397690/extras/ce9d384719fc514949adb183a36e0217.mp4?t=1747414907\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Join the team of bounty hunters assembled by Dr. William and complete challenging missions. Use the money you earn to make your train more comfortable or invest in more effective equipment to chase bigger rewards. Make sure to collect the targeted amount of valuable gems on the last day of the cycle!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3397690/extras/09ab332a8b0e91f55aae4fb03756203a.poster.avif?t=1747414907\" width=800 height=64 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3397690/extras/09ab332a8b0e91f55aae4fb03756203a.webm?t=1747414907\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3397690/extras/09ab332a8b0e91f55aae4fb03756203a.mp4?t=1747414907\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In a town that you will only visit at night like experienced bounty hunters, you will have limited time to move unnoticed. Complete your mission within the given time and make sure you leave no one behind from your team!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3397690/extras/7e9453bb63b8a00751be73f0157decf0.poster.avif?t=1747414907\" width=800 height=64 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3397690/extras/7e9453bb63b8a00751be73f0157decf0.webm?t=1747414907\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3397690/extras/7e9453bb63b8a00751be73f0157decf0.mp4?t=1747414907\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>WestFall \u2013 Can You Survive the Cursed West?</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>\u201cThe cursed town of the West\u2026 Every bounty hunter's soul eventually finds its way to WestFall.<br>Some came for fortune, others for fame. But none ever returned.\u201d</i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>WestFall</strong> offers a thrilling co-op survival experience set in a dark Western universe.<br>Rotting saloons, abandoned mines, and haunted train stations fill a land where every footstep echoes\u2014but who\u2019s listening remains a mystery...</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You and your crew are bounty hunters, scouring the outskirts of the town to recover valuable loot and pay off your debts. But when night falls, the spirits of the past awaken. Now, you're not just fighting for riches\u2014you're fighting for your soul.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Key Features:</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Horror + Western Fusion:</strong> A one-of-a-kind survival experience in a gothic Wild West setting.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Co-op Gameplay:</strong> Team up with 1-4 players. Take the job. Make it out. Or vanish forever.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Dynamic Missions:</strong> Each run brings new threats, rewards, and a different fate.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Mysterious Enemies:</strong> Ghost cowboys, vengeful spirits, and shadowy unknown horrors.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Time-Based Tension:</strong> When the sun sets, it doesn\u2019t just take the light\u2014it takes the hope with it.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In WestFall, your courage, your silence, your strategy\u2014and your loyalty\u2014will all be tested.<br><strong>Remember:</strong> Everyone who enters WestFall\u2026 ends up on the wanted list.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3397690/extras/ce9d384719fc514949adb183a36e0217.poster.avif?t=1747414907\" width=800 height=64 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3397690/extras/ce9d384719fc514949adb183a36e0217.webm?t=1747414907\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3397690/extras/ce9d384719fc514949adb183a36e0217.mp4?t=1747414907\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Join the team of bounty hunters assembled by Dr. William and complete challenging missions. Use the money you earn to make your train more comfortable or invest in more effective equipment to chase bigger rewards. Make sure to collect the targeted amount of valuable gems on the last day of the cycle!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3397690/extras/09ab332a8b0e91f55aae4fb03756203a.poster.avif?t=1747414907\" width=800 height=64 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3397690/extras/09ab332a8b0e91f55aae4fb03756203a.webm?t=1747414907\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3397690/extras/09ab332a8b0e91f55aae4fb03756203a.mp4?t=1747414907\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In a town that you will only visit at night like experienced bounty hunters, you will have limited time to move unnoticed. Complete your mission within the given time and make sure you leave no one behind from your team!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>",
